# Services

At LCC Telecom Services, we offer a wide range of engineering services. Whether you need a telecommunications design consulting firm or need help with permit processing, we can help. We offer the following service lines:

## DAS Design

Designing Distributed Antenna Systems in venues, hospitals, government facilities and other in-building and outdoor structures.

## Small Cell Networks

LCC Telecom Services provides small cell network design services for macro network improvement projects.

## Wireline/Broadband Services

LCC Telecom Services provides Wireline/Broadband Services including FTTx engineering, Make Ready engineering, MDU design, and permitting services.

## Colocation/Site Acquisition

Site acquisition, colocation and land use entitlements.

## Construction Oversight

Managing the installation of the telecom equipment.

## Permitting Services

Our permit processing team handles telecommunications permit applications through the entire approval process. We specialize in small cell and DAS permitting, with experience in residential, commercial, and government applications.
